#: ../../tools/datagov_tools.rst:32 57962c24a5f4407f9b8679a9e604a875
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search the US federal open data catalog (Data.gov) for "
"datasets from agencies like EPA, CDC, Census Bureau, NIH, USDA, NOAA, and"
" more. Data.gov uses the CKAN API and indexes over 300,000 federal "
"datasets. Returns dataset titles, descriptions, organizations, download "
"resource URLs, tags, and last-modified dates. Use organization filter "
"(e.g. 'epa-gov', 'cdc-gov', 'usda-gov', 'nih-gov', 'census-gov', 'noaa-"
"gov') to narrow results to a specific agency."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/datagov_tools.rst:34 de31aaead1aa48e788e4429537090a4c
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/datagov_tools.rst:36 a11d83c82c294ecdbdefdcc9ba10ceb0
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Search keywords for dataset discovery. "
"Searches across dataset titles, descriptions, and tags."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/datagov_tools.rst:39 45b2c5b466784a40a066d92d5d0d8364
msgid ""
"``organization`` (string, null) (optional) Optional CKAN organization "
"slug to filter by federal agency. Examples: 'epa-gov', 'cdc-gov', 'usda-"
"gov', 'nih-gov', 'census-gov', 'noaa-gov', 'nasa-gov', 'nsf-gov', 'doe-"
"gov', 'hhs-gov'. Leave null to search all agencies."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/datagov_tools.rst:42 91cc409531a143a08a6aa82b3515088b
msgid ""
"``rows`` (integer) (optional) Number of results to return. Default 10, "
"maximum 100."
msgstr ""

